       57 XXSYSEXEC  DD DSN=L&CEN.&AMBL.00.SYSTEM.INPUT,DISP=SHR                  00001600
          IEFC653I SUBSTITUTION JCL - DSN=LCP00.SYSTEM.INPUT,DISP=SHR
       58 XXPARMDD   DD *,SYMBOLS=JCLONLY
